From 1406e21bc7b0ccd04cad533e33b6d0ff3933a26f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph <joseph@giallovision.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:29:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Every ControlNet unit's Source TOP defaults to
 /project1/final_out; Force Re-render Sweep

- feed_N_top default final_out (baseline 3: empty fields pick it up on rebuild); the Select TOP gets the resolved absolute path
- Sweep Depth > Force Re-render Sweep (and Force Preprocess) bypass the sweep cache; sweep_preview lets go of the file first

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhiEzmwUbwDK67k3BY9b4Y
